  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "🔍 Cross Search — DSH-Plugin",
      "text": "> **多引擎交叉驗證搜索**:Brave / Tavily / DuckDuckGo / Wikipedia(可選 Bing / Mojeek)並行查詢,URL 去重,**按獨立引擎同意數分置信度**——單引擎結果誠實標為 LOW。\n\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@bryan-cmf/dsh-cross-search)\n[](LICENSE)\n[](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Confidence tiers",
      "text": "| Tier | Condition | Meaning |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 🟢 HIGH | ≥ 50% of running engines agree | independently verified |\n| 🟡 MEDIUM | ≥ 2 engines agree | partially verified |\n| 🔴 LOW | single engine | honest unverified |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Tool",
      "text": "`cross_search { query, engines?, limit? }` — parallel fetch, URL dedupe\n(tracking params stripped), tiered ranking, engine provenance per result."
    },
    {
      "section": "API keys (env)",
      "text": "| Engine | Env var | Keyless fallback |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Brave | `BRAVE_API_KEY` | — |\n| Tavily | `TAVILY_API_KEY` | — |\n| Bing | `BING_API_KEY` | — |\n| Mojeek | `MOJEEK_API_KEY` | — |\n| DuckDuckGo | — | ✅ (HTML endpoint) |\n| Wikipedia | — | ✅ (REST API, `wikiLang` config) |\n\nMissing keys skip that engine; the report always states which engines ran."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```jsonc\n\"dsh\": { \"profile\": { \"bundles\": [\"@bryan-cmf/dsh-cross-search\"] } }\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Configuration",
      "text": "| Key | Default | Meaning |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `engines` | brave, tavily, duckduckgo, wikipedia, bing, mojeek | Attempt order |\n| `timeoutMs` | `8000` | Per-engine timeout |\n| `perEngine` | `8` | Results per engine |\n| `wikiLang` | `zh` | Wikipedia language |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "```bash\npnpm install --store-dir .pnpm-store\npnpm build\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
